1 ABANDONED SHIPWRECK~
The Abandoned Shipwreck is a grounded vessel off the northeastern coast of Vas
with its broken stern submerged beneath cold water, while the bow rests above.
Crates of liquor, alchemical goods and forty pillows remain stowed below deck,
beside an invoice and key to the captain's locked cabin.~
